text.section:
Each application for registration or renewal shall contain:

The name of the service agency, including any fictitious names under which it intends to operate;


The principal business address of the service agency;


The name of every person functioning as a service technician in the Commonwealth who is in the employ of the service agency;


Documentation of verification pursuant to § 3.2-5706 of the weights or measures standards and calibrating equipment used or to be used by the service agency;


The fee required by § 3.2-5704; and


Proof of a uniquely identifiable security seal for the service agency.
